##Benchmark for coupled double well model

This folder contains the converged results for a simulation on a 128x128 grid for the 1-state double well model.

Parameters:
constexpr double eta = 1/1.3544;
constexpr double b =  1.0;
constexpr double c =  1.0;
constexpr double d = 0.0; //Linear Coupling


After compilation or modification this model can be run to compare results and ensure no bugs were introduced. The input file to run the calculation is in INq, grid parameters are defiend in globals.hpp. Data can be compared to the .dat files in this folder. 
